* Components
M1 3 6 0 0 NMOS
LP 4 2 Lp_value
RP 2 3 Rp_value
CP 3 5 Cp_value
C2 5 0 C2_value
Iin 6 0 DC Iin_value
Ib 0 7 DC Ib_value
Vb 6 0 DC Vb_value
VDD 2 0 DC Vdd_value

* Node map
* 0 : Ground
* 2 : VDD
* 3 : Vout
* 4 : Inductor LP node
* 5 : Capacitor C2 node
* 6 : Input voltage and bias node

.end